ry from the feed, a story hidden out of band is excluded from the feed, and archive works (`status` is also a reserved word). The fake table follows DynamoDB's reserved-word rules, so the tests fail on the old code.\n\nNothing was deployed.\nE\npython3 -m unittest discover tests 2>&1 | tail -3"}}}
